---
import QuestTerminal from "../islands/QuestTerminal";
// The quest card is a small playable terminal (QuestTerminal.tsx).
---

<section class="j-scene w-school" id="school" data-world="school" data-chapter="02 · Gamified School · Game" aria-label="Gamified School project">
	<div class="j-stick">
		<div class="j-copy">
			<p class="j-tag rv">02 · Flagship software</p>
			<h2 class="rv" style="--d:60ms"><span>GAMIFIED</span><span>SCHOOL</span></h2>
			<p class="j-lede rv" style="--d:140ms">
				A hands-on learning platform for the college students I was teaching. Docker and
				PostgreSQL are simulated right inside the app, so students practise real commands with
				nothing to install, and courses in Git, Docker, PostgreSQL and system design play out as
				quests.
			</p>
			<ul class="tags rv" style="--d:200ms">
				<li>GIT</li>
				<li>DOCKER</li>
				<li>POSTGRESQL</li>
				<li>SYSTEM DESIGN</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		<div class="rv" style="--d:220ms">
			<QuestTerminal client:visible />
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
